    "course_pol": "Class Regulations:\n1. \nStudents are required to participate actively in class, including answering questions, participating in group work,\nas well as class discussion. \n2. \nFood, drinks and the use of mobile are not allowed in class. Violations will be reflected in the final grade of the course. \n3. \nThere will be NO make-up quizzes for ANY reason. Also, late assignments will NOT be accepted.\n4. \nBeing late for 5 minutes will be considered an absence.\n5. \nIf you are absent for 6 classes of the semester (including sick leave, leave for personal reasons and school\naffairs), you will lose 10 points of the final grade.",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>1.</div>\n\n<div>Students must exhibit honesty and ethical behavior in their academic activities, avoiding plagiarism and</div>\n\n<div>falsification of data.</div>\n\n<div>學生在學術活動 中必須展現誠實和道德行為，避免抄襲和篡改資料。</div>\n\n<div>2.</div>\n\n<div>Plagiarism: Proper citation of sources is required. Copying or using others&#39; work without appropriate attribution is considered</div>\n\n<div>plagiarism.</div>\n\n<div>抄襲:必須適當引用來源。未經適當標示使用他人作品屬於抄襲行為。</div>\n\n<div>3.</div>\n\n<div>Cheating: Following exam rules is mandatory. Unauthorized materials or collusion with others during exams is considered cheating.</div>\n\n<div>考試 作弊:必須遵守考試規則，禁止使用未經授權的材料或與他人串通作弊。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
